"test":{"name":"ai-no-ghost-from-nested-transport","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"nestedGhost","question":"From a game (Mekong Delta): a transport VTOL carrying a supply unit had landed on a destroyer, and the AI moved the VTOL as the supply unit's ride while it was still aboard. Each such move left the tile it went to naming it as the occupier while it stayed aboard (a ghost that blocked paths, supply and could be attacked). Over Blue's turns no unit aboard is moved, and every tile's occupier stands on it and is not aboard anything.","rules":"standard"},
